// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2533255127" "Return with the files"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1228443580" "This is too sensitive for the airwaves. Come and talk to me in person."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3149532140" "This is brilliant work, {HeroName}. I knew you could handle this! <br><br>It's time to take the next step, but first we need to be sure that this is legit. Nemesis has been using sub-plans and subterfuge to confuse and misdirect pursuers for decades, and we can't be entirely sure that these records weren't planted by Nemesis for us to find as part of a larger scheme. <br><br>I can verify them, though, by checking against other suspected Nemesis activity we've learned about from other sources. If there are any matches, we may have the real deal. <br><br>This could be just what we're looking for. <br>According to the records, there should be a hidden weapons lab under this warehouse. The warehouse itself has seen a few big deals go down between Nemesis agents and Freakshow, and there have been Jaeger sightings in the area, too. <br><br>I want you to look for the lab beneath that warehouse. If it exists, then these records are a breakthrough. Or, at least, we can assume that they're probably not planted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P210082916" "Defeat all Nemesis in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
