"P3332544666" "I don't care where you do it, just take out enough Nemesis troops to make it look convincing. If any of them actually talk, so much the better."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2667378001" "One of the defeated Nemesis soldiers actually did talk, but your cover is secure either way. Time to hit the research base."

