// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Railtracks 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1405762177" "Strange railroad tracks"
// DetailString :
"P578028170" "Though this section of railroad track looks normal, a cross section reveals not only a strange series of layers made of weird alloys, but what appears to be circuitry imprinted throughout the length of the rail."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Railnet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1481745300" "A map of the rail network"
// DetailString :
"P2892703192" "This map is a complete chart of America's railroad system, showing which parts of the railroads use Nemesis' augmented rail tracks. You notice that there are a number of gaps with completion dates, leaving sections of Nemesis' network cut off. Still, there are thousands of miles of Nemesis' altered rail tracks all over the country."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P780046039" "I've been going through these old business records you dug up on Nemesis' front companies, and I've noticed something odd. It looks like Nemesis was heavily investing in companies that produced railroad tracks for decades, starting during the second world war and continuing until the late 90's. He went out of his way to make sure that his tracks were used in any major rail project. That's more than a little suspicious in my book. After the Rikti War he gutted the companies and let them fail, but I found an old warehouse that might still hold samples of those rails. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to get samples of those rail tracks and have them analyzed.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P71651314" "Get samples of those rail tracks and have them analyzed"
// SendOffString :
"P2753437446" "Nemesis still owns the warehouse through other front companies, so there may be opposition on site. You just need to get me a sample of those railroad tracks. Nemesis doesn't work to corner a market on something like that without a more sinister reason. Once you have a sample, take it to Anton Sampson over in Founders' Falls for analysis. I've worked with Anton before when I needed to decipher Nemesis' technology."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3865442673" "Get track sample"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P158386237" "Once you get that sample and get it analyzed, we may get a better idea of what Nemesis has been up to, and how to stop it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P654211027" "You don't know what to expect in here, but the key to a mystery is somewhere in this place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3530357687" "I'm not sure I trust these sneaks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3581173294" "They will serve their purpose."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP_ONE 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP_TWO 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_ONE_INACTIVE_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_ONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3348987019" "It's not as if {HeroName} were going to barge in here or something!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_ONE_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_ONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4041635728" "I am not sure that this negotiation is truly secure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_TWO_INACTIVE_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_TWO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3586824364" "We can sort who betrayed whom out later!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2338057707" "{HeroName}! We are betrayed! The Center will hear of this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P498075501" "Lt. Epstein"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P114969032" "Dr. Ulecht"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2923228892" "Rail track scrap"
// Description :
"P2484858494" "Find track sample"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2185545326" "You begin opening the crate."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1981819548" "You have opened the crate."
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P845820210" "You found a strange railroad track cross section."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3347687196" "You found a strange section of rail track. You must take it to Anton Sampson for analysis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1705360849" "Get info from Anton Sampson"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3732656425" "Talk to Anton Sampson over in Founders' Falls. He's really familiar with Nemesis' technology and should be able to figure out what the story is on those strange railroad tracks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P603271308" "You have something that belongs to Lord Nemesis, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2011077408" "I've done an analysis of the track segment you brought. It's really something else. They look like railroad tracks, and will carry a train, but they have another purpose. They can be manipulated to send out signals that can interfere with electromagnetic activity. With the right tuning, they could take over electronics, or even potentially overwhelm brain activity. You'd need a vast amount of this stuff laid out in a network for it to be of any use, though. Like, say, a railroad network. <br><br>Hold on, I have a call from {ContactName}.<br><br>Yeah, {HeroName} is right here.<br>Yeah, that sounds like the kind of equipment.<br>I just don't think it was finished. <br>Okay. No, it's not worth the risk. I agree.<br><br>All right, I have another mission for you. I don't know how he's getting this information, but your friend gave me a location for you to strike. He says it's probably the command center for this network. I don't think the project was finished, or Nemesis would have used it, but I'm in agreement that we can't take the chance. You're to go to this location, take out the base, and look for any kind of outline of the network. Good luck."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound3_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2796101465" "Defeat all in rail center"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3846733127" "It's like I had Sampson tell you, you need to take that control center down. Anton may not think that the whole grid was ever finished, but we can't take that chance. See if you can find a map of the rail lines, too. This is gonna cost billions to clean up, but it's the only way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P276438989" "Though any legitimate businesses are long gone from this old building, Nemesis has remodeled a section of this place as a control center for his mind controlling rail network."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2724383504" "It's been the work of decades, but soon this project shall be complete."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3448418890" "Lord Nemesis sends his apologies that he cannot crush you in person."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4233599765" "Railcontrol mainframe"
// Description :
"P757231901" "Find a rail map"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1294236294" "You found a map of the Nemesis controlled sections of the railroad network on this computer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P992141466" "You have taken the control center and found a map of Nemesis' rail network."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2740308763" "As far as I can tell, Nemesis never finished the rail network to his satisfaction. If it had been operational, he could have used the special tracks to send signals to override mental functions. Electric brainwashing, and it would have been completely invisible. Or, with enough power, he could have fried any electronics in the world. Pretty terrifying. <br>I've studied Nemesis. My entire career, most of my life really; I've studied him. I know him as well as anyone can. What you have to remember is that Nemesis really thinks that he's a good guy. He thinks the world will be a better place under his 'benevolent' rule. So he doesn't want a nation of mindless drones. He wants people to love him of their own free will. Like pets. The command center's only record of him using it at all was during the Rikti War, probably to help kill troublesome heroes or protect his own bases. <br><br>This is going to take billions of dollars to clean up, but that's better than leaving it in his arsenal. This may have just been a back-up weapon as far as Nemesis was concerned, but it was a gun at the temple of every free mind on Earth."
// RandomFameString :
"P1575011821" "I heard you've been hitting Nemesis like a freight train, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AutoVamp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4131989802" "A disassembled robotic vampyr imposter"
// DetailString :
"P4229834903" "This automaton is a perfect replica of one of the Council's vampyri. Its abilities and strength have been replicated using Nemesis' advanced technology. When assembled and powered, it would be indistinguishable from an actual vampyr."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P847291786" "Nemesis likes to get top talent wherever he can find it, and he doesn't mind taking people from other organizations. I've been looking through the records you found, and noticed that he made a big push on hiring ex-Council members a few years back. Those men were all assigned to part of Nemesis' automaton fabrication division, and I think they're still working there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>They're all wanted men, and that's a good enough excuse to send you in there to raid the automaton research lab and figure out what they've been working on.</A> This is a hunch, but I have a feeling that could be a very interesting place."
// AcceptString :
"P2558895593" "Raid the automaton research lab and figure out what they've been working on"
// SendOffString :
"P991950961" "Defeating the men in there is fine, but the real goal for us is to find out what they're working on. I have to wonder why Nemesis transferred these ex-Council guys to his automaton group? All of Nemesis' designs are originals using his own technology, so it's unlikely that he was hiring them to improve his own automatons with Council designs. They'd be completely incompatible. It's a mystery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1189584728" "Find automaton research"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P319396616" "No one would be upset if you take out that lab completely, but all you really need to do is find out what they've been working on. Any ruckus or collateral damage to the facility is a bonus on top of that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2410381959" "This smallish lab has been hidden underground, but seems to be well-equipped with Nemesis-designed robotics gear."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2726548472" "Who made the coffee this morning?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1159113591" "I need to see those TPS reports!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2896325815" "Did someone park in my employee of the month spot?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1591353956" "Bagels in the conference room."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P199451906" "Lieutenant Exley"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3386901021" "The next batch of infiltrators should be ready for delivery quite soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1729373176" "You'll never get out alive, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P710254019" "Vampyr automaton"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P206340734" "Automaton diagnostics complete. Ready for emplacement."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3869127205" "Automaton Parts"
// Description :
"P296144333" "Locate automaton research"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1806262850" "You found a disassembled vampyr automaton!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P790711195" "You found evidence that Nemesis has infiltrated the Council with automatons!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1086926345" "Talk to {ContactName}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3233105154" "Call me paranoid, but I think we need to talk about this face to face."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P158489656" "You can't stand up to Lord Nemesis!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1936193745" "Vampyr imposters? I gotta admit, I admire his guts sometimes. Only Nemesis would be that bold. It makes sense, though. Normal troops go through so much mental and physical indoctrination and examination that an automaton would get caught, and Council robots are so different from Nemesis' technology that it would be easy to tell an imposter. <br><br>It's kind of funny, but it still has to be stopped. If Nemesis could subvert a big enough portion of the Council, it could be a disaster. I need you to take out one of these imposters right in a Council base, where all the troops can see it. You'll also need to take out the rest of the command staff just to make it look normal, but I'm confident you can handle that.<br>Don't worry that we're helping the Council, either. They'll have to spend so much time testing all of their vampyri, this will derail their operations for months."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound4_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2399093693" "Stop fake vampyr & associates"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3478984033" "Remember that while your target is the vampyr automaton, you'll need to take out the surrounding command staff to make this look like a normal raid. Don't worry about defeating every last one of them, though. We want word to get out about Nemesis' infiltrators."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2391874650" "This Council base is being run beyond even the Council's normal standards of efficiency."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3580881272" "I think we should alter our plans to a degree."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1730258549" "{HeroName}? Your presence is outside parameters."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3988961696" "You defeated the Vampyr automaton, revealing its presence."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1275878928" "We knew that Nemesis used his automaton imposters to take over businesses, run front companies, and spread confusion during disasters. But I guess no one ever thought about him using the automatons against rival villain groups. Really, it makes sense, though. As far as Nemesis is concerned, everyone is just a tool to be used in his bid for power."
// RandomFameString :
"P1884671045" "You're the real thing in the fight against Nemesis, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3840356021" "The information you found has been golden, {HeroName}, but it's not going to be worth a damn if Nemesis figures out that we have it. If he knew about the records you found, then he could cover his tracks and all of that work would be wasted. So, I'm going to have to ask you to do something so that we can keep Nemesis in the dark about what we know. I won't lie to you; it's going to be dangerous. Incredibly dangerous. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you say yes, you'll have to walk into a Nemesis trap, but it may throw him off the trail.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2656664413" "Walk into Nemesis' trap to throw him off the trail"
// SendOffString :
"P3927177393" "Okay, the set-up's pretty simple. Nemesis is getting suspicious about the high success rate against his plans recently, so he's set up a fake base and dropped a lot of subtle hints about its location. If I didn't have the records you found, I wouldn't even suspect that this was a trap, but with them I can tell that the place was built way too recently for it to truly be a super weapon development center. All you have to do is take out the base commander, just like in a real attack. That won't be easy, because Nemesis has this place full of deadly weapons and agents ready to hurt you badly. Take teammates for this one. Take a lot of teammates if you can."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3639813312" "Defeat leader of trap base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2872974589" "Treat this like it was a normal strike. You don't have to take out all of them, but find the base leader and his cronies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4038239464" "You have no hope against Lord Nemesis, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1079544559" "Knowing that this is a trap doesn't lessen the danger in here. Nemesis will pull out all of the stops in this place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3599373632" "Ah, {HeroName} has arrived. Just in time!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P341778442" "You'll never succeed against the power of Nemesis!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1617899997" "We are to attack {HeroName} without mercy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2275908724" "Nemesis sends his regards, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P530719143" "Lord Nemesis watches through my eyes. Show valor, one and all!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2854684692" "Lord Nemesis sends condolences over your coming demise, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2201175509" "Rally around! We shall not fail Lord Nemesis!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4280913665" "You've come this far only to die, {HeroName}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1546087984" "You have succeeded and survived Nemesis' trap."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2933839138" "There were how many of those fake Nemeses in there? You fought like a champion out there today, {HeroName}. Nemesis must really be have a block in his smokestacks over this, you just cost him like half a billion! At this rate, we may defeat him through bankruptcy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RiktiAutomaton 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2324829222" "Debris from a Rikti automaton"
// DetailString :
"P1268041211" "These parts and pieces were originally part of a Nemesis' Rikti imposter automaton. The engineering work is incredible, allowing this robot to perfectly mimic a Rikti soldier in every way. As you examine the parts, you have to wonder just how extensive Nemesis' knowledge of the Rikti truly is."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3883399612" "These records you found are incredible, they've helped me put together so many of my suspicions about Nemesis' plans. It's not evidence, though, and that's what I want to talk to you about. You know that Nemesis uses robotic duplicates to infiltrate enemy groups, right? Well, the records you found seem to confirm that one of his infiltration projects has been targeted against the Rikti. <br><br>It's a wild thought, but if anyone could do it, it would be Nemesis. The problem is, until one of those imposter Rikti gets brought in, I don't have any evidence that I can take to my superiors. I've been able to track down where some of these Rikti automatons are likely to be. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I just need someone to defeat one of Nemesis' Rikti automatons and bring back the evidence.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4018733074" "Defeat one of Nemesis' Rikti automatons and bring back the evidence."
// SendOffString :
"P2142538414" "I've marked a good place to go looking for one of those automatons."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1320992485" "Defeat automaton & nearby Rikti"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1484655902" "Once you have the evidence from the automaton, talk to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1005791563" "The Rikti have grown accustomed to quickly setting up makeshift bases anywhere they can. It looks like these caves have been used as staging areas before."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2316247875" "Rikti automaton"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2089940605" "You destroyed the Rikti automaton and gathered its debris."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4276271293" "That Rikti imposter was amazing, and not just because it looked indistinguishable from a normal Rikti. Think about it: As far as we know, the Rikti communicate with some kind of artificial telepathy. So for the imposter to be able to pass itself off as a real Rikti, that means that Nemesis must not only understand their language, but also have a way to replicate Rikti artificial telepathy! It's the only way. <br><br>I was expecting that, though. I didn't tell you before because I wasn't 100% sure, but those records you found hint that Nemesis was working on an imposter Rikti almost 10 years ago, long before the war. <br><br>That's something to think about, huh?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

