// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound7_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1531224106" "Ask Tina to verify coordinates"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4259433429" "Tina Macintyre can probably tell you if those coordinates are legitimate. If they are, then it might be possible to cut off that dimension completely."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2893427007" "Tell us what you got from that Nemesis Rex base, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2146249338" "I've checked over the coordinates. We haven't sent a probe through, but they do appear to be real. Now that we know what to look for, we've found several dimensional transits that might originate from that place as well. Dr. Kellerfield's been very helpful to us as well, filling in details about their dimensional transit array. I think that we should be able to cut off their dimension, but we'll need to shut down their portals before their next mass transit, or else they may be able to keep their end open. Unfortunately, those modifications will have to be done over in their world.<br><br>You'll need to travel to the home dimension of this Nemesis Rex and alter his portal emitters, {HeroName}. I can only hope that you're up to the task."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound7_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
