"P4177444028" "You have destroyed this stockpile of weaponry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3415442125" "The portal devices have been altered. You need to leave before the gateway is closed forever!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3758120376" "Portal Corporation is pretty certain that Nemesis Rex's world has been cut off for good, or at least until we want to open the connection again. I feel kind of bad for the people there. According to Dr. Kellerfield, it didn't sound like a great place to live. It does make you think about all that we've done, though. I've spent my whole career working against Nemesis. Sometimes it's felt impossible or futile, but I guess the fact that Nemesis Rex existed there and not here shows that it wasn't a waste, you know? I wonder, though, how many other worlds have been conquered by their version of Nemesis? <br><br>Version of Nemesis?<br><br>Ah, hell.<br><br>Hey, {HeroName}, I just had a thought: What if we were just used? What if we've just done Nemesis' dirty work for him? I mean, think about it. Our Nemesis knew about Nemesis Rex, right? A rival with nearly his own power, and with more resources. So what if he set us up to take Nemesis Rex out? Plans within plans are Nemesis' specialty. What if we were just caught in one? We did the right thing either way, I suppose. I just hate to think of Nemesis gloating about it."
// RandomFameString :
"P2470373344" "I heard you took on a Nemesis from another world! Is that true, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PortalAlts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Doomsday 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2736587103" "The Neurophagic Disruptor"
// DetailString :
"P556855607" "The complex circuitry covering this fragile-looking sphere is burned out from the one time it was ever used. That one use was enough to burn out the mind of every living human being in a split second. This half-fused sphere in your hand is almost too much to imagine. This is a doomsday device."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2097879907" "I got something from the Portal Corporation explorers across my desk. Seems that one of their exploration teams was trying to regain contact with a friendly dimension, but instead found a nearly abandoned world that was being overrun by Devouring Earth creatures. They also found a Nemesis Army expedition who were there to retrieve the doomsday device that had killed 70% of that world's population. The explorers couldn't stop the Nemesis expedition, but they got back alive and told what they saw. <br><br>That's where you and I come in. If Nemesis has some kind of doomsday weapon powerful enough to wipe out most of a world's population, we can't let him keep it. The records you found and reports of Nemesis Army activity have helped me pinpoint where they might be keeping that thing. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>All that left is for you to get the doomsday device out of Nemesis' grasp and get it to safety for analysis.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P689447186" "Get the doomsday device out of Nemesis' grasp"
// SendOffString :
"P1322246832" "It's hard for me to even imagine a device that could snuff out 70% of the people in the world. Nemesis can't be allowed to have that kind of power. Once you've got the device, take it to Dr. Steven Sheridan. I'm sure he'll have some valuable insights."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound8_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P727611487" "Get the doomsday device!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P102392289" "Nemesis can't be allowed to keep that doomsday device. He's a big enough threat to the world without that kind of power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P72829196" "Nemesis has built this high tech lab in hidden caverns deep within the Earth. You hate to imagine the dreadful experiments that have been conducted down here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1478123969" "Patrol duty really stinks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1766152662" "I know. I almost wish something would happen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1493351762" "We have an intruder! To battle stations!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4098159675" "You'll not escape from us, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Safe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3573643922" "Wall safe"
// Description :
"P3795654573" "Find the doomsday device!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P4257618816" "You begin opening the safe."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1302313110" "You have opened the safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3720105056" "You found the doomsday device."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1273243837" "You located and secured the doomsday device. You now need to take it to Dr. Steve Sheridan for analysis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound8_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3740844748" "Deliver device to Dr. Sheridan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1897046767" "You need to get that thing to Dr. Sheridan. He should be able to analyze it safely."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P432175231" "You won't escape us, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3855921018" "I've concluded my analysis, {HeroName}, and I must say that I'm rather shocked by the results. One of the mysteries we'd been trying to understand is what happened on that world? Who would have set off a device with so catastrophic a result? I now think we know. This Neurophagic disrupter is Nemesis technology. It's burned out and useless now, but I can say with near certainty that this was made by Nemesis. I doubt he'd be able to make another one, as there isn't enough of the required iridium isotope on our planet, but that's small consolation to the people of that ruined world. <br><br>This also coincides with observations our explorers have made, and your friend {ContactName} has confirmed. Nemesis Army forces from our world seem to be setting up a beachhead or perhaps a colony on that now abandoned world. I'd hate to see that monster profit from all of this tragedy. We can open a portal to that world again, and over there you should be able to cut off Nemesis' access to that dimension. I'll call Portal Corporation and set the whole thing up. They'll need to construct a force field around a small portion of that world, in order to keep it stably linked to our own."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_Compound8_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P667252758" "Alter portal devices"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P385259852" "Sheridan is right. We can't let Nemesis take advantage of that world. We can open up path back to it later to provide aid, but we won't be able to do anything for them if Nemesis colonizes that world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2012689702" "The once bright buildings of this world are now hanging in rags."

