"P1369978068" "You have destroyed this stockpile of Nemesis Army weaponry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3486542836" "You've sealed off access to this dimension."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3380724488" "Nemesis almost had an entire world to use as a base of operations, {HeroName}. No doubt he was planning for the long term. What really sickens me is that he was willing to kill so many people to do it. <br><br>It got me thinking: why he didn't just threaten to use that device here? From the records you found, it looks like he was planning this for some time. I think I figured out why he chose that world, too. According to Portal Corporation files, through some twist of fate the population of that world was mostly of African descent. To Nemesis, their skin color alone made the lot of them less than human. That monster probably didn't think twice about murdering them.<br><br>That's what Nemesis is, {HeroName}. That's the kind of evil we're fighting against."
// RandomFameString :
"P2160169393" "Any world, anywhere! You'll stop Nemesis in his tracks, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_KillTask1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P263572552" "It looks like Nemesis has noticed your rate of success against his plans. He's put an order out to make you a top target for his troops. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think it might be a good idea to do the same and show Nemesis that you won't be intimidated by defeating Nemesis Army troops.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1621871771" "Show Nemesis that you won't be intimidated by defeating Nemesis Army troops"
// SendOffString :
"P435970689" "You're just as tough as I thought, {HeroName}. Nemesis' forces are fair game anywhere they show up. What matters is that they know you're on the job against them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P483838720" "Defeat Nemesis troops"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1164039759" "Nemesis' troops are still gunning for you {HeroName}. You need to show them that whatever they give you, you'll give them back twice more."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3612302966" "Lord Nemesis doesn't want you to interfere, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1111438103" "You have successfully shown that you can handle whatever Nemesis sends against you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P977032060" "I've been investigating Nemesis my whole career, {HeroName}, and I've seen a lot of other heroes who were too afraid to face him and his forces. I'm glad to know that you have what it takes."
// RandomFameString :
"P2341577668" "I heard Nemesis was hunting you, {HeroName}. Weren't you scared?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_KillTask2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3574571033" "Your recent successes against Nemesis have things a little hot. Nemesis forces are watching what you're doing, but that could actually be a good thing. I've sent another hero on an investigation based on the old business records you found a while back. Thing is, she could use a little cover to distract Nemesis, and that's where you can help. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could attack Nemesis' forces to distract them, you could provide cover for that other investigation by drawing attention to yourself.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4165957178" "Attack Nemesis' forces to distract them"
// SendOffString :
"P3379298248" "Any move you make against Nemesis Army forces will be perceived as significant, so you won't have to do much other than fight them. And I know you can handle that. Good luck."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3471298196" "Distract Nemesis forces"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1098889238" "Keep up the good work. Nemesis forces are already re-deploying after you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3294470138" "You'll make no move against Lord Nemesis today, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3504420516" "You've successfully distracted Nemesis for long enough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2912812560" "I think you can relax for a bit. The operation's done, and Nemesis didn't know anything until it was too late. I got a lot of interesting information out of it, which should complement what you've already gathered. I'm finally starting to get a complete picture of the full scope of Nemesis' organization. Maybe I should be afraid, but really, I just feel eager to break it all down."
// RandomFameString :
"P1389453464" "{HeroName}! Nemesis doesn't stand a chance against you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis_KillTask3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4017757461" "Nemesis' troops have been getting nervous lately. A lot of their morale relies on the feeling of being invincible they get from working for Nemesis, and you've had a few too many successes against them lately for them to feel that invincible lately. I'd like to keep that pressure up. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I don't have anything intricate right now, though, so I'd like you to put pressure on Nemesis' forces the old-school way.</A> Find them, confront them, and defeat them."
// AcceptString :
"P3432754821" "Fight Nemesis' forces to keep up the pressure"
// SendOffString :
"P3315321445" "It's really simple: just take out Nemesis Army forces wherever you find them. They'll get the message wherever you go and do it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2076632" "Fight Nemesis Army"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P641612083" "I've been doing this for decades, and believe me, you have no idea how good it feels to see Nemesis worried for once."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4118825254" "Lord Nemesis is watching your every move, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P639615325" "You've successfully put pressure on Nemesis' forces."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1484871664" "I just got a call from the home office, {HeroName}. A platoon of Nemesis soldiers just gave themselves up. That's never happened before. Ever. It's completely unprecedented in Nemesis' entire history. It may be part of a larger Nemesis plot, but on the one-in-a-hundred chance it's real, this is incredible, and we owe it to you."
// RandomFameString :
"P2798228328" "I saw Nemesis troops looking for you, {HeroName}. They seemed kinda scared to find you."
